    "text": "By Jane Caroline Fusco ,\n6 hours ago ORANGEBURG COUNTY, S.C. (WCIV) — A Holly Hill family of six is trying to rebuild after an early-morning fire destroyed the home they had lived in for nine years, leaving them with little more than the clothes they were wearing. Kimberly Walters said she had already left for work... Read full article\n1",
